{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "70bfef4adad574ee5b152dbb167604646d64aa5e9985d13c77179a132a980ff9", "ja": "令嬢の見せ場", "zh": "大小姐的精彩看点", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "162975f8e52350e237c734c8fae75d38d482a92c9bd0018773ad76d97a9d793f", "ja": "映画の撮影が始まり、舞踏会のシーンを撮り\r\n終えたアイドル達。その仕上がりは完璧で、\r\n一発ＯＫをもらえたことに手ごたえを覚え\r\nつつも、いよいよクライマックスシーンの\r\n撮影へと臨むのであった。", "zh": "电影拍摄正式开始，偶像们顺利完成了舞会场景的拍摄。成品堪称完美，一次就获得了通过，让她们深感振奋。而此刻，她们即将迎来高潮场景的拍摄。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "c8cda9a4629968e6e267a9fcecd9b958f8b30cbd02c7bd34887826e0ce5b441b", "ja": "（映画はいよいよ、クランクインを迎えた！\n撮影は今のところ、つつがなく進行している……）", "zh": "（电影终于开拍了！\n目前拍摄进展顺利……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_06_1001_028ari", "source_sha256": "21bb5cdb3c3e346c919c08885f23374db6f5996643df787573a0f6ecaedc8887", "ja": "舞踏会のシーンは、今ので終わりですかね……？\nなんともいえない緊張感がありました……。", "zh": "舞会的场景，现在就结束了吗……？\n真是种难以言喻的紧张感……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_06_1002_036kan", "source_sha256": "9238e9963cd3b9fe9b0a952a851bc62fc4f024c7ab65a4aae20749c8739b7d0f", "ja": "私も、上手くできるかなってヒヤヒヤしちゃって……\nでも、一発でOKがもらえて良かったです！", "zh": "我也一直担心自己能不能做好……不过能一遍就通过，太好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_06_1003_006mak", "source_sha256": "e4af19776fcb233c296f5e4e0460dc8b0c9f6b1e7a205a049905b8eecd409ea7", "ja": "他の出演者の人たちも完璧に仕上げてきてるし。\nボクたちも、伊織のレッスンが活かせたみたいだね。", "zh": "其他出演者也都准备得很完美呢。\n看来我们也把伊织的指导派上用场了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_06_1004_007ior", "source_sha256": "35679cfa95499e727d5e5765f2cdd12e1ce2177e794c3f8061802ab07943f544", "ja": "伊織ちゃんが先生をしてあげたんだから、\n当然の結果でしょ？　にひひっ♪", "zh": "既然伊织可是亲自当了老师，这不是理所当然的结果吗？嘻嘻♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_06_1005_028ari", "source_sha256": "b0ad0af186eb59b2792d4b6e57635ab390ebdc0d6a19a1eea1af574b8a29ca9c", "ja": "この後は、静香ちゃんの牢獄のシーンと……\nアパテットの本性が本格的に露わになるシーンですね！", "zh": "接下来是静香的牢狱场景，还有……アパテット的本性彻底暴露的场景呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_06_1006_036kan", "source_sha256": "872fcb5c4fd1282658ac6431fcd165f109183f952f263a03517642491d96bc62", "ja": "さっきまでとは違う意味で、すっごく\n緊張しますけど……がんばります～！", "zh": "和刚才不一样，这次是另一种意义上的紧张，不过……我会加油的～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_06_1007_015siz", "source_sha256": "35d6bb3c60fbd561ee990c93a96ce1f791a42b54f44df0dfd668f83c6dd6ca37", "ja": "くっ……この！\nダメだわ、びくともしない……。", "zh": "可恶……这个！\n不行，纹丝不动……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_06_1008_015siz", "source_sha256": "29d1116cbdf8eba4bd53ba111bac167142d8171b1cacc26d93fd4955bdfc6a72", "ja": "3日後には、アパテットとシトリム王子の\n婚約式が行われてしまう……時間が……！", "zh": "3天之后，阿帕泰特和希特里姆王子的\n订婚仪式就要举行了……时间已经……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_06_1009_015siz", "source_sha256": "7614941bc8f871d1d1e1fd2360ac334df9c167fb3f457baa4a7f9f468a17c537", "ja": "アパテットのこと、何とかして王子に伝えなくちゃ。\nそれに、サーフィア様……ああ、どうかご無事で……！", "zh": "无论如何都必须把阿帕泰特的事告诉王子才行。\n还有萨菲娅大人……啊，求求您一定要平安无事……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_06_1010_031tom", "source_sha256": "aac7aa47474dd4bebb4572939033d377a7261ffe3f978a6b44b238f7cc1c6067", "ja": "……ご命令通り、あの女の身柄は\n旧市街の牢に幽閉しております。", "zh": "……遵照您的命令，那个女人\n已被幽禁在旧城区的牢房里了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_06_1011_036kan", "source_sha256": "ef5760c3117390aa26a4d2033bdb0949fc82a88c2135f80f1d18a6978ef839d2", "ja": "そう、わかったわ。……また何かあったら呼ぶから、\n下がりなさい。くれぐれも、誰にも見つからないよう。", "zh": "嗯，知道了。……要是再有什么事，我会叫你的，\n退下吧。务必不要被任何人发现。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_06_1012_031tom", "source_sha256": "be52baa920ea3a3894da99ce9cd3b4766223f0298de3d5fed9b3f2325545a9a3", "ja": "はっ。", "zh": "哈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_06_1013_036kan", "source_sha256": "1a784aae513d03b48aa61ad3034a765643ae52247b8316cdcb40b3e933deb76d", "ja": "最初から気に入らなかったのよね。\nサーフィアも、ソウヤも……。", "zh": "从一开始就看不顺眼。\n萨菲亚也好，索亚也好……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_06_1014_036kan", "source_sha256": "7e2411529f42a4ee3b203142a8659d3ec1d264d345d083a770766aa04cd8c5ad", "ja": "あと3日……婚約さえ結ばれてしまえば、\n全てが終わるわ。あの女も、この国も……。", "zh": "还有3天……只要订下了婚约，\n一切就都结束了。那个女人也是，这个国家也是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_06_1015_036kan", "source_sha256": "bb291b646781ba1e9e45ac2d27bfb92922a034c373d6291f204f71284621ddd8", "ja": "あなたたちに、最悪の結末を見せてあげる……\nどんな顔をするか、今から楽しみだわ！", "zh": "让你们见识一下最糟糕的结局……\n真期待你们到时候会露出什么样的表情！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_06_1016_036kan", "source_sha256": "5e832bbbf28f7db7c5b15904c1ece754dd5794910a1e1e565e327dec847c0548", "ja": "ふっ、ふふふっ……あーっはっはっはっは！", "zh": "呵、呵呵呵……啊哈哈哈哈哈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_06_1017_se", "source_sha256": "c01f9901aa06ad650b314d5a929022d1574a5f17402b31fd5bd6359592e719d6", "ja": "コンコン、ガチャ", "zh": "咚咚，咔嚓", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_06_1018_028ari", "source_sha256": "f198c2eb0aead02973b3b1abdfa7a43862b6b91ae047c21f2b11886f7879ca48", "ja": "アパテット、何かあったのかい？\n大きな声がしたから、様子を見に来たんだけど……。", "zh": "ア帕特特，出什么事了吗？\n听到很大的声音，所以过来看看情况，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_06_1019_036kan", "source_sha256": "6ad6a57322de135f3fd1b2a1fa54d06644b814923df21920a2852265fe23ea5e", "ja": "はっ！？　……コホン。い、いやですわシトリム様。\n私、大きな声なんて……オホホホホ……。", "zh": "啊！？……咳咳。哪有啊，希特里姆大人。我才没有大声说话……哦呵呵呵呵……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_06_1020_007ior", "source_sha256": "922f7d2da552b02296719695f4a19687efc0ceec48a0567ffcc0c08f06050ee7", "ja": "ソウヤ、ソウヤー！\n本当に、どこにいってしまったの……？", "zh": "索雅，索雅——！\n你到底去哪儿了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_06_1021_007ior", "source_sha256": "f1d28be332feb03db5e8472b088bdb9ea307b85f6cea93e863bc64babed14e31", "ja": "こんなに探しても見つからないなんて……\nやっぱり、事件に巻き込まれたとしか思えないわ。", "zh": "找了这么久都没找到……果然只能认为是卷入什么事件了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_06_1022_006mak", "source_sha256": "c3872f1be3e7aa4a992c298965cee1d8e9a2db2683700c8c7b971a30eeec25e3", "ja": "やぁ、レディ。\nそんな血相を変えてちゃ、美人が台無しだな。", "zh": "嗨，女士。\n你这样慌慌张张的，可就糟蹋了这副美人相啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_06_1023_007ior", "source_sha256": "dcf0257f1f1d2cf7de1060b6a86c2c05a79128762f267d9732bc849760863880", "ja": "トルマン公爵……またアンタなの？　悪いけど、\n今はアンタの軽口に付き合ってる暇はないのよ！", "zh": "杜尔曼公爵……又是你？抱歉，我现在可没工夫陪你说这些俏皮话！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_06_1024_006mak", "source_sha256": "5873146650d6120466ab9ea15c2088f98b1f3969d5c400ac2176dfa95424464f", "ja": "まぁ、待ちたまえ。\n君の大切な人を探しているんだろう？", "zh": "等等，先别急。\n你是在寻找对你来说很重要的人吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_06_1025_007ior", "source_sha256": "1c66d20bcf47cf21ac9cc21e18efb276d2d80ec4faba56d0367ca79cb4cfafe6", "ja": "っ！？　ど、どうしてそれを！？\nもしかして、アンタがソウヤを……。", "zh": "！？　你、你怎么知道的！？\n难道说，是你把苍也……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_06_1026_006mak", "source_sha256": "2f10af80ded022f82708275223a33bf6cfa0fa48005729f4e14ed51b9bb24e9b", "ja": "まさか！　オレが彼女を拐って、なんの益がある？\nそれにどうせ拐うなら、君も連れていくさ、レディ。", "zh": "怎么可能！我拐走她能得到什么好处？再说了，既然要拐走，当然也会把你一起带走，小姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_06_1027_007ior", "source_sha256": "1020333660a8121fcf6bac2f1d3eb391ef0639a6271b1d0a3aef447e0a014206", "ja": "ちょっと、気持ちの悪いこと言わないでよ！\nまったく、相変わらず胡散臭い男ね。", "zh": "喂，别说这么恶心的话！\n真是的，你还是一如既往地可疑。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_06_1028_007ior", "source_sha256": "df64bb37a56d5f559ae49451e65d86f594f20f18af72ab009591980487a65b5a", "ja": "でも、たしかにアンタの言うとおりよね……\n疑って悪かったわ。", "zh": "不过，你说得确实没错……\n之前怀疑你，对不起了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_06_1029_006mak", "source_sha256": "060b89e2ac61779081a94b57b59460fa132d151aa0f60a6dfc8f126c3a2c10e4", "ja": "いいさ。けどオレなら、君の力になれると思わないか？\nこう見えて公爵だ、それなりの人間を動かせる。", "zh": "没关系。不过你不觉得，换作是我的话，就能帮上你的忙吗？\n我虽然这副模样，但好歹也是个公爵，还是能调动相应人手的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_06_1030_007ior", "source_sha256": "b69e7e87b9646ffbd5fdb0a6a1be39b639cc156b542686b43e6128775cbd049f", "ja": "なら、ソウヤを探すのを手伝ってくれる？\n昨晩からずっと、姿が見えないの！", "zh": "那么，你能帮我找找宗也吗？\n从昨晚开始就一直不见人影！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_06_1031_006mak", "source_sha256": "613383b0fe0b2942e2143d2b033b90c11b91083254866964acaaa202e85923e8", "ja": "お安い御用さ！\nその前に……ひとつ、聞かせてくれないか？", "zh": "小事一桩！\n不过在那之前……能先告诉我一件事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_06_1032_007ior", "source_sha256": "3ee23c6a873c770052b148d399d331d76ad5004894a64047e9caa435ab42ff30", "ja": "な、何よ？", "zh": "什、什么嘛？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_06_1033_006mak", "source_sha256": "7175785a6c3621ce45f9a2c4f69d05260601fdba5a5df9b9d471b4c963da50d4", "ja": "たかが侍女を助けるために、どうして君は、\nそんなに必死になれるんだ？　プライドはないのか？", "zh": "仅仅为了救一个侍女，你为什么能如此拼命？你就没有自尊心吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_06_1034_007ior", "source_sha256": "1c41c3dbebbde10fa322206ba61dfc46da86e0fcd830db908f678397d030f3d9", "ja": "プライド？\n……バカね、そんなのあるに決まってるじゃない。", "zh": "自尊心？\n……真是的，当然有啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_06_1035_007ior", "source_sha256": "0a0da1c08daaacbe2e47cb705be79cec2722c1cd038aa08e148d5390e8e0860a", "ja": "ソウヤは侍女で、私にとって一番大事な友達よ。\n友達を助けるのが、私のプライドだわ！", "zh": "索雅是侍女，也是对我来说最重要的朋友。  \n帮助朋友，就是我的骄傲！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_06_1036_007ior", "source_sha256": "91bf3f52cecacd44f1d20f64f4c408f0f808d26288b592182c6c7107d9cb5e7f", "ja": "そのためなら、なんだってやるわ。\n私が、そう決めたのっ！", "zh": "为了那个，我什么都愿意做。\n这是我自己决定的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_06_1037_006mak", "source_sha256": "cbee686dad31cc777ad2d8e9dbe89f82c78dcc9c403df026ead938af3c8bd271", "ja": "ふ……あははははっ！\nその目、どうやら本気みたいだね。", "zh": "呵……啊哈哈哈哈！\n看你的眼神，看来你是认真的呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_06_1038_006mak", "source_sha256": "c522af33d460027be12e60c9e11a43b317e9b5d77f8a2b13cd63ef9100f81e96", "ja": "伯爵令嬢が自分の体裁でなく、ただ友のために\n体を張る！　したいからそうするだなんて……！", "zh": "伯爵千金竟然不顾自己的体面，只为了朋友挺身而出！居然还说是因为想做所以才这么做……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_06_1039_007ior", "source_sha256": "db168299c304acf3b18c9a4a2c1813bb725830890c58e1b6bfaf92223ac21d87", "ja": "ちょっ……そんな大笑いするようなこと！？", "zh": "等……至于笑得这么夸张吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_06_1040_006mak", "source_sha256": "b1029203994a5a4167424b165c964b05100df1803b308480d7445213dc282b32", "ja": "いやー、君は本当に面白い子だな。\nこんなに愉快な気持ちになったのは久しぶりだよ！", "zh": "哎呀——你真是个有趣的孩子啊。\n让我感到这么愉快，真是久违了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_06_1041_006mak", "source_sha256": "48292570ce676b9b003134ed2e93d6a82bd482e171443cfd7624d6b5c4cc942d", "ja": "サーフィア、君のその想いは尊いものだ。その想いに\n敬意を表して、このトルマンが協力しようじゃないか！", "zh": "萨菲娅，你的这份心意十分高尚。为了向这份心意表示敬意，就让这个托尔曼来助你一臂之力吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0320_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0320_story_06_1042_p", "source_sha256": "4775e1ea853b5599e4c50abf4b02c3b5259fd3078afcc93b029d9e08683b2453", "ja": "（みんな、しっかり自分の役を演じられているな。\nこの調子で、最後まで走りきれますように……！）", "zh": "（大家似乎都能好好演绎自己的角色了。希望能保持这个状态，一直到最后……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
